1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,600
The only Wei's Purple Peony in the garden.

3
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,040
It alone reigns over
all the other peonies.

4
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:50,360
I think only a peony
of such peerless beauty

5
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:51,920
is worthy of you, My Lady.

6
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,200
What have you put in my hair?

7
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,680
Slap yourself!

8
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:14,520
You witless fool.

9
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:15,880
My Lady is to meet Lord Lu,

10
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,280
yet you keep going on about being "alone."

11
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,480
You deserve those slaps.

12
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,320
Don't be angry, My Lady.

13
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:23,720
She's a clumsy speaker
who doesn't know any better.

14
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:32,080
How about this twin-lotus hairpin instead?

15
00:01:32,160 --> 00:01:33,840
Twin blossoms are an auspicious sign.

16
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:37,040
The design symbolizes "hearts as one".

17
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:40,560
May you and Lord Lu be of one heart
and enjoy a lasting marriage.

18
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:33,120
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

19
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:39,840
ELDEST PRINCESS'S RESIDENCE

20
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,280
<i>At the Eldest Princess's flower banquet,</i>

21
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,440
<i>you are sure to outshine every lady</i>
<i>and take first place.</i>

22
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,480
WEI RAO
OLD MADAM WEI'S FOURTH GRANDDAUGHTER

23
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,040
<i>Lord Lu.</i>

24
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:17,920
I hear the Duke's ailment has returned,

25
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,600
and none of the capital's
finest physicians can cure him.

26
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,760
LU ZHUO, HEIR TO THE DUKE OF YING

27
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:23,520
I have some Dragon's
Blood Wound-Healing Powder.

28
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,640
It's especially effective
for chronic sores that refuse to heal.

29
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:30,400
The Duke fought on the battlefield
for over 40 years.

30
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:33,200
My grandfather
has always admired him greatly.

31
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,680
My family offers this medicine
with no other intent

32
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:39,040
than to show our respect
for the old hero's deeds and virtue

33
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,480
and do what little we can.

34
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:44,520
I hope you won't refuse it.

35
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,120
Jiede, take it.

36
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,080
Yes.

37
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,800
Please thank your grandfather for me.

38
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,480
When he recovers, I shall come by to

39
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:02,080
express my gratitude.

40
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:14,640
XIE HUALOU,
GRANDDAUGHTER OF THE GRAND TUTOR

41
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:18,200
They say Lord Lu is stern and aloof,
keeps everyone at a distance,

42
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,480
and avoids women in particular.

43
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,360
But from what I saw just now,

44
00:05:22,440 --> 00:05:24,600
he was quite cordial to you.

45
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,000
Don't talk nonsense.

46
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:29,240
Lord Lu is already betrothed.

47
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,400
When it comes to family standing,

48
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,080
your grandfather is a renowned scholar
who has served

49
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,360
as Grand Tutor to two emperors.

50
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:35,960
Your family's standing far surpasses
that of the Wei family.

51
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:40,400
As for talent, you excel at music,
weiqi, calligraphy, and painting,

52
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,240
and poetry and verse
come effortlessly to you.

53
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,560
Yet I've never heard of any talent
from that Lady Rao.

54
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,680
All she has is a reputation for beauty,

55
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,400
BITAO
MAID AT EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

56
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,880
but she is rarely seen publicly
and is always kept hidden away.

57
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,480
Who knows whether the beauty is true?

58
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:54,560
And don't get me started
on her birth mother.

59
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,720
Her conduct and character

60
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,360
- are the subject of endless gossip.
- Enough.

61
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,840
Is it your place to say such things?
Let's go.

62
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:11,920
Lady Wei, the other ladies are already
waiting in the reception pavilion.

63
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:14,560
I'm feeling a little stifled.

64
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:17,040
I'd like to walk in the garden
and clear my head.

65
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,680
When I was little,

66
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,720
I often came here with Grandmother
to visit the Eldest Princess.

67
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,840
There's no need to show me the way.

68
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,800
Please inform the Eldest Princess

69
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,080
that I will arrive
before the banquet begins.

70
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:28,920
Yes.

71
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,560
Weren't we supposed to enjoy the view
at the waterside pavilion?

72
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,000
Why was it changed to here?

73
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,320
Her Highness said
Diecui Pavilion offered a commanding view,

74
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,440
and the scenery
would be even finer from up high.

75
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,840
Seize her.

76
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,480
What are you doing?

77
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:24,040
Who's the empty-headed beauty?

78
00:07:25,400 --> 00:07:27,200
Whose birth mother
is too shameful to mention?

79
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:34,840
And whose conduct and character
are the subject of endless gossip?

80
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:39,840
Lady Wei, my maid spoke out of turn
and offended you.

81
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,520
But she's blunt by nature
and meant no harm.

82
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,960
What's the rush?

83
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,920
I haven't forgotten you.

84
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,160
You shameless wretch.

85
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:50,840
What a fine maid you've trained.

86
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:53,840
Lu Zhuo has been betrothed to me
since childhood.

87
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,440
That makes him mine.

88
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,520
How dare you set your sights on him?

89
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,480
Shoucheng.

90
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,320
QI ZHONGKAI,
SECOND SON OF THE MARQUIS OF PINGXI

91
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,320
I heard your fiancée is here today too.

92
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,800
You're about to leave for war.

93
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:12,840
Aren't you going to say goodbye to her?

94
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,880
- Mind your own business.
- Come on.

95
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,840
Old Madam Wei guards Lady Wei Rao
like the apple of her eye

96
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,920
and rarely lets her leave the house.

97
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,520
Everyone says she's a great beauty.

98
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,720
Just how beautiful is she?

99
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,480
Put more thought into your training.

100
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,120
Something's happened at Diecui Pavilion!

101
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:33,039
I'd sooner see anything that belongs to me

102
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:37,760
ground to dust than share
even a fraction of it with anyone else.

103
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:42,919
Xie Hualou, how dare you compete with me?

104
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,680
- I didn't…
- Do you have what it takes?

105
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,360
Lu Zhuo! What's going on?

106
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,600
How did she just fall from up there?

107
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,960
DIECUI PAVILION

108
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,680
My Lady, someone else is here.

109
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,440
What are we going to do?

110
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:18,160
Jiede, guard the garden entrance.
Let no guests in or out.

111
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,680
- Yes.
- Qi Zhongkai,

112
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:20,760
please fetch the Eldest Princess yourself.

113
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,240
All right.

114
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,480
Lord Lu, please…

115
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,800
Save me.

116
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,800
Please save me.
Wei Rao is trying to kill me.

117
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,920
DIECUI PAVILION

118
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,840
My Lady…

119
00:10:10,280 --> 00:10:11,280
Don't make a sound.

120
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:27,080
DIECUI PAVILION

121
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:32,080
Bitao!

122
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,480
Bitao!

123
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,720
How vicious of you!

124
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,600
Pingxiang!

125
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:45,440
- What exactly happened here?
- Pingxiang!

126
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:47,200
Why are you two ladies not at the banquet

127
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:49,880
but lingering here
at the secluded Diecui Pavilion?

128
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,160
And how did Lady Xie fall from up here?

129
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:54,080
Your Highness!

130
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,720
I happened to run into Lady Xie
in the garden just now.

131
00:10:58,320 --> 00:11:00,520
She warmly invited me to walk with her,

132
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,360
then complained the sun was too harsh.

133
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,640
So she suggested we rest in the pavilion.

134
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:07,840
Out of kindness, I sent my maid back to
the carriage for some cooling balm.

135
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,360
But then,

136
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,080
she suddenly confessed to me that

137
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,000
she loves Lord Lu for long

138
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:15,160
and asked me to break off
my engagement to him.

139
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,080
Embarrassed, I tried to leave,

140
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:19,480
but she was on her knees and begged me

141
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:21,520
to give up the engagement.

142
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,480
I tried repeatedly to reason with her,

143
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,320
but she turned malicious.

144
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,560
Thankfully, my loyal maid Bitao
stepped in to protect me,

145
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:32,040
and Lady Xie lost her footing
during the struggle.

146
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,560
My poor maid.

147
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,040
Her face…

148
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:44,520
Wei Rao, you're twisting the truth
and making false accusations!

149
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,520
You pushed me!

150
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,640
Your Highness, Lord Lu,

151
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:52,760
my personal maid Pingxiang
can testify for me.

152
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,960
Pingxiang!

153
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,640
- Pingxiang…
- She's unconscious.

154
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,240
I'm afraid she can't testify for now.

155
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,760
Lady Xie,

156
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:14,480
does this gold hairpin belong to you?

157
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,240
If my two maids hadn't been so alert,

158
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:51,080
they came back halfway while feeling off,

159
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:56,160
I fear I might never have seen you again,
Lord Lu.

160
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:58,280
To escape blame,

161
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:01,440
you've done nothing but lie
and smear my name.

162
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:03,160
Have you no conscience at all?

163
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:10,440
To save my maid just now,

164
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:14,600
I fought to wrest the hairpin away,
which is how I got this wound.

165
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,760
Please, think carefully.

166
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,680
This is the Eldest Princess's residence.

167
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:21,520
I have been strictly taught by
my grandmother since childhood.

168
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,680
How could I possibly be
so vicious and reckless?

169
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:25,520
And where would I find the nerve?

170
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,360
I have been wronged for no reason.

171
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:35,600
Your Highness, please see justice done!

172
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:39,720
Your Highness, please clear my name!

173
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,880
Lu Zhuo,

174
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:46,440
which one of these two beauties
is telling the truth?

175
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:49,600
Lord Lu, what do you think?

176
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:03,960
Only the Xie and Wei families' servants
were in the pavilion.

177
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,640
No outsider was here
to serve as a witness.

178
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:08,280
Both sides now tell different stories,

179
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,360
so even Your Highness
may find it difficult to judge.

180
00:14:12,160 --> 00:14:13,800
Lady Xie has clearly suffered
a terrible fright

181
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,080
and is in quite a disheveled state.

182
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:16,080
It may invite unwanted gossip.

183
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,480
Perhaps she should remain here for now,

184
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:20,520
freshen up, change her clothes,

185
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,680
and then be escorted home.

186
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:25,520
Lord Lu, that seems appropriate.

187
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:28,200
Well, escort your fiancée home first.

188
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,160
Thank you, Your Highness.

189
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:56,960
ELDEST PRINCESS QINGYUAN'S RESIDENCE

190
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:07,200
Recently, the Hutuo have been raiding
our northern border,

191
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,640
leaving border families destitute
and driven from their homes.

192
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,240
I volunteered to lead a campaign
against them,

193
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,920
and the army will depart soon.

194
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:17,960
When I return,
I'll come to your residence in person

195
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,640
to call off the marriage,

196
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,160
and end our engagement.

197
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,320
You want to break off?

198
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:39,840
I've seen countless corpses
on the battlefield.

199
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:43,400
The cause of a blade wound
can't be twisted by mere words.

200
00:15:44,520 --> 00:15:47,480
Whether she attacked you first
or you wounded yourself to frame her

201
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,360
can be determined by measuring the wound.

202
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:52,240
The wounds are distinctive
in depth and shape.

203
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:54,560
The railing she fell from

204
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:57,120
and the way she landed
can also provide clues.

205
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:59,080
Ultimately, the culprit

206
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,680
will have nowhere to hide.

207
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:06,200
I didn't do it.

208
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:09,400
Why do you trust an outsider over me?

209
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,720
Such a beautiful face.

210
00:16:13,480 --> 00:16:15,360
Such flawless, delicate hands.

211
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,400
Yet the heart inside you

212
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:20,720
is more venomous
than any snake or scorpion.

213
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:23,280
I didn't expose you in front of everyone

214
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:25,880
because I wouldn't tarnish
your family's reputation

215
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:31,760
or let Uncle Wei's lifelong reputation
be ruined by his own daughter.

216
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,320
That's right.

217
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,320
I pushed her.

218
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:53,160
Too bad fate wasn't on my side
and you happened to catch her.

219
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,920
Back at Qiyang Pass,

220
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,760
my father carried your father out
through a mountain of corpses,

221
00:16:58,400 --> 00:17:00,920
only to suffer grievous wounds himself
and bleed to death.

222
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,240
His death left me an orphan,

223
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,240
and now you want to break off
our engagement?

224
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:11,319
In your dreams.

225
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:15,200
Your family owes me.

226
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:18,880
And so do you.

227
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:21,599
You say I'm as venomous as a snake?

228
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,520
How pitiful.

229
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:29,280
You are destined to share a bed with one,

230
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:33,720
and you'll never escape me
for as long as you live.

231
00:17:34,960 --> 00:17:36,600
Then just wait

232
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,240
and see how I end this engagement.

233
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:44,920
Lu Zhuo!

234
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:56,960
- Make way!
- Check this out.

235
00:17:57,040 --> 00:17:58,400
- Clear the road!
- Sir, look at this!

236
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,840
Move aside!

237
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,040
You there, make way!

238
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:02,680
Trinkets!

239
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:06,680
<i>Then just wait</i>

240
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:10,040
<i>and see how I end this engagement.</i>

241
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,960
Come take a look!

242
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,240
Make way!

243
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:18,480
It stinks!

244
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,600
- My goodness.
- It stinks!

245
00:18:32,640 --> 00:18:33,720
Are you blind?

246
00:18:33,800 --> 00:18:35,600
- Watch where you're going!
- I was blind and careless

247
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:36,760
and offended Her Ladyship.

248
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,360
I'll clean it up at once.

249
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,760
Sir, don't go!

250
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:41,480
What rotten luck.

251
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:43,360
You fouled my lady's carriage.

252
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:44,960
You deserve to be taught a lesson!

253
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:50,760
- You ugly night-soil woman!
- It was my fault.

254
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,760
Please have mercy.

255
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,440
It was my fault. Please have mercy.

256
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,320
Please have mercy.

257
00:18:59,240 --> 00:19:01,800
- Please have mercy.
- Give her 20 lashes. Let's go.

258
00:19:12,440 --> 00:19:14,840
A-CHOU

259
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,040
That sickly consumptive woman

260
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,040
does nothing
but bring me bad luck every day!

261
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,920
She's made me lose every last coin again!

262
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,440
Stop coughing! Hold it in!

263
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,000
Get out!

264
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:35,680
You ungrateful little wretch!

265
00:20:35,760 --> 00:20:37,640
How dare you raise a hand
against your own father?

266
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,480
You'll be struck by lightning one day!

267
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:53,480
A-Chou, you're back.

268
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:03,680
Don't mind your father.

269
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:08,880
Once he's had too much to drink,
he stops acting human.

270
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:14,760
What happened?

271
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,400
What's happened to you?

272
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,520
You're covered in wounds.

273
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:21,880
Who did this to you?

274
00:21:23,040 --> 00:21:23,880
Ma,

275
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:26,760
I hate this so much.

276
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:32,760
We were born never knowing
a full belly or warm clothes.

277
00:21:34,120 --> 00:21:36,440
We sleep at midnight and rise before dawn,

278
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,880
go door to door collecting swill,

279
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:47,080
scrub chamber pots, and wash clothes
until our hands split open.

280
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:50,880
Why should we have to live like this?

281
00:21:55,080 --> 00:21:56,280
It's my fault.

282
00:21:57,440 --> 00:22:00,360
I brought you
into a family trapped in such misery.

283
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:06,000
My good girl,
who can refuse the fate they're born into?

284
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:07,720
I refuse!

285
00:22:09,120 --> 00:22:12,400
Ma, I'm not some lowly pig or dog.

286
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,960
I'm a human being.

287
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:20,800
Just wait and see.

288
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:25,920
I won't spend my whole life
as mud beneath people's feet.

289
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,960
If Heaven gives me
so much as a single vine,

290
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:33,720
I'll cling to it with everything I have
and climb upward no matter what it takes.

291
00:22:35,640 --> 00:22:37,200
I'll get you treated

292
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:41,920
and make sure my younger siblings
never go hungry or live in fear again.

293
00:22:44,560 --> 00:22:46,480
I'll live like a real human being.

294
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,360
ZHAO

295
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,600
The Hutuo have invaded again,

296
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:59,040
but with Lord Lu commanding our forces,

297
00:22:59,120 --> 00:23:00,160
we'll surely crush the enemy!

298
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:05,240
Victory! Victory!

299
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:06,560
Victory!

300
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:08,080
Victory!

301
00:23:08,160 --> 00:23:09,280
Victory!

302
00:23:09,360 --> 00:23:10,520
Victory!

303
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:13,120
Knowing how you feel,

304
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:15,080
the Dowager Lady made an exception
and let you see him off.

305
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,600
When Lord Lu sees you,

306
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,880
he'll surely be overjoyed.

307
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:25,000
TRIUMPH TAVERN

308
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:29,960
Lord Lu will be victorious!

309
00:23:39,120 --> 00:23:39,960
What are you looking at?

310
00:23:41,120 --> 00:23:43,600
A vile shrew. Pay her no mind.

311
00:23:46,520 --> 00:23:52,640
Victory!

312
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:53,800
Outside the Eldest Princess's
Residence that day,

313
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:55,240
he could hardly bear to say goodbye.

314
00:23:56,320 --> 00:23:58,560
He promised me he'd come to our residence

315
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,920
to propose once
he returned to the capital.

316
00:24:01,400 --> 00:24:03,000
That's wonderful news!

317
00:24:03,080 --> 00:24:06,480
The Dowager Lady has been eagerly awaiting
this day for so long.

318
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:09,560
I'd better hurry back and tell her,

319
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:12,200
Lady Guo, and Lady Heng'e.

320
00:24:12,280 --> 00:24:15,160
We need to start preparing
for the wedding.

321
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:16,400
Indeed.

322
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:20,640
I'll wait here in the capital
for Lord Lu to return

323
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,600
so we can finally be married.

324
00:24:24,120 --> 00:24:25,800
HENGCHENG GATE

325
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:33,080
Lu Zhuo,

326
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,160
you have no choice.

327
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:41,640
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE,
TWO MONTHS LATER

328
00:24:41,720 --> 00:24:43,120
WEI RAO'S DOWRY LIST

329
00:24:43,200 --> 00:24:44,840
GOLD, LANDS

330
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,280
CALLIGRAPHY AND PAINTINGS,
SCROLLS, GOLD BRACELETS AND RINGS

331
00:24:58,400 --> 00:25:02,080
Massaging this Hegu Point
is good for your eyes.

332
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:03,680
I know you're a devoted granddaughter.

333
00:25:03,760 --> 00:25:04,400
OLD MADAM WEI, MATRIARCH,
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

334
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:06,480
Whenever my glaucoma flares up,

335
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:08,080
I get terrible headaches,

336
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:12,080
and everything becomes a blur.

337
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:14,240
But over the past month,

338
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:17,520
the pork liver and cangshu congee
you've been sending me

339
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:18,240
WEI CHAN
OLD MADAM WEI'S THIRD GRANDDAUGHTER

340
00:25:18,320 --> 00:25:20,480
has helped a great deal.

341
00:25:24,600 --> 00:25:27,400
Mother, these bowls and fruit plates

342
00:25:27,480 --> 00:25:30,120
have such distinctive designs.

343
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:31,560
Your recommendation was excellent.

344
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:34,040
Silversmith Zhang's craftsmanship

345
00:25:34,720 --> 00:25:36,440
certainly lives up to its reputation.

346
00:25:36,520 --> 00:25:38,320
Ever since the girls were born,

347
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:43,760
we've been setting aside
clothes, bedding, and dowries for them.

348
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:47,000
Yesterday, I had the treasury opened
and drew up the dowry list.

349
00:25:47,080 --> 00:25:51,120
I've always had a soft spot for Rao.

350
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:53,320
I simply couldn't bear to see her go,

351
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:56,920
so I took the liberty of
adding a few more things.

352
00:25:57,000 --> 00:26:00,960
That makes 128 loads of dowry in total.

353
00:26:01,040 --> 00:26:03,000
Good. Very good.

354
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:08,480
Heng'e, take a look
and see if anything's missing.

355
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:14,240
You're always so thorough, Yufeng.

356
00:26:14,320 --> 00:26:16,920
This list couldn't be more complete.

357
00:26:31,200 --> 00:26:35,200
Rao, look at what I've prepared for you.

358
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,320
Do you like it?

359
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:41,680
What a beautiful necklace!

360
00:26:41,760 --> 00:26:44,520
I've been searching for two years
and haven't found one of this quality.

361
00:26:45,520 --> 00:26:46,880
Aunt Heng'e, why not give it to me?

362
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:50,480
Fine jewels for a beautiful lady.

363
00:26:52,760 --> 00:26:55,080
Come. Let me put it on you.

364
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:02,480
They suit you perfectly. Beautiful.

365
00:27:03,440 --> 00:27:04,920
Aunt Heng'e, you're so biased.

366
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:08,000
What? Is Rao your only niece,

367
00:27:08,080 --> 00:27:09,960
and I'm just someone
you found on the street?

368
00:27:10,520 --> 00:27:12,800
Chan, mind your manners.

369
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:14,760
How can you compare yourself to Rao?

370
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,880
She's had so little love from her parents.

371
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:19,600
Naturally, I tend
to favor her a little more.

372
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,760
When it's your turn to get married,

373
00:27:21,840 --> 00:27:24,200
I'll have something special for you too.

374
00:27:25,960 --> 00:27:26,840
Chan.

375
00:27:28,760 --> 00:27:30,760
You're her older cousin.

376
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:33,520
Instead of showing your younger cousin
some love and consideration,

377
00:27:33,600 --> 00:27:36,200
you're getting jealous over a gift.

378
00:27:36,280 --> 00:27:40,680
How can you be so petty
and show so little sisterly affection?

379
00:27:40,760 --> 00:27:43,480
Write out <i>Lessons for Women</i> ten times!

380
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:50,760
I wouldn't dare give away
a gift from Aunt Heng'e.

381
00:27:50,840 --> 00:27:52,480
I have another fine necklace in my room.

382
00:27:53,280 --> 00:27:55,200
I'll have someone send it to you
this afternoon.

383
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,080
Please don't upset Grandmother.

384
00:27:58,120 --> 00:28:00,080
Who needs you pretending to be nice?

385
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:03,440
You're all so biased it's beyond belief!

386
00:28:04,040 --> 00:28:05,360
I don't want your necklace!

387
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,240
Chan!

388
00:28:08,320 --> 00:28:10,160
She's so childish.

389
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:14,240
Rao, don't take it to heart.

390
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,680
Pay her no mind.

391
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:18,360
As long as I'm here,

392
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:20,560
I'll see to it that you
have a lavish dowry

393
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:24,280
and marry into the Lu family
in grand style.

394
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,920
Thank you, Grandmother.

395
00:28:29,240 --> 00:28:30,360
I'll go find Chan.

396
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,960
Rao is certainly the more sensible one.

397
00:28:41,280 --> 00:28:43,720
Those two girls quarrel
every time they meet.

398
00:28:44,320 --> 00:28:46,080
I really don't know what to do with them.

399
00:28:46,800 --> 00:28:48,480
They're actually very close.

400
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:50,600
LOTUS ROOM

401
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:53,680
Dowager Lady, the army has returned
from its campaign against the Hutuo.

402
00:28:53,760 --> 00:28:54,680
Is it?

403
00:28:54,760 --> 00:28:57,120
- Did we win or lose?
- We won! A great victory!

404
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,040
- Wonderful!
- Excellent!

405
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:01,400
- Congratulations, Dowager Lady!
- What wonderful news!

406
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,320
Wonderful!

407
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:04,440
Congratulations, Mother.

408
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:07,280
His Majesty will surely reward
Lu Zhuo handsomely.

409
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:08,600
We won the battle,

410
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:11,440
but I've heard people
around the capital saying

411
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:14,360
that Lord Lu may not survive.

412
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,360
What?

413
00:29:18,120 --> 00:29:20,160
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

414
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,760
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

415
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,320
Within two weeks of reaching the frontier,

416
00:29:27,840 --> 00:29:29,880
Lu Zhuo drove the main Hutuo army
back north.

417
00:29:30,400 --> 00:29:33,960
That night, he led 3,000 cavalrymen
in a raid on the enemy camp.

418
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:37,760
But somehow, the Hutuo had been tipped off
and laid a trap in advance.

419
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:39,080
DUKE OF YING

420
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:40,120
We fought desperately to break through,

421
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:43,480
DUCHESS OF YING

422
00:29:45,120 --> 00:29:46,640
suffering heavy casualties.

423
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:04,960
Lu Zhuo!

424
00:30:15,760 --> 00:30:18,600
<i>Lu Zhuo was struck by a poisoned arrow.</i>

425
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:21,400
<i>Despite his injuries,</i>
<i>he charged into the enemy ranks</i>

426
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:24,120
<i>and</i>
<i>beheaded the Hutuo's Left Wudu Marquis,</i>

427
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,960
<i>Xiahou Xian.</i>

428
00:30:27,120 --> 00:30:28,520
<i>Our commander was gravely wounded,</i>

429
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:29,920
<i>but the Hutuo were thrown into disarray.</i>

430
00:30:30,760 --> 00:30:32,000
<i>Our troops' morale soared,</i>

431
00:30:32,080 --> 00:30:33,560
<i>and we pressed home our advantage.</i>

432
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:35,400
<i>The Hutuo have surrendered</i>
<i>and sought imperial recognition,</i>

433
00:30:36,520 --> 00:30:38,160
but my dear friend…

434
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:43,240
Quick! The medicine!

435
00:30:53,280 --> 00:30:55,600
Physician Zhang, my son…

436
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:56,600
- Madam!
- Stay calm.

437
00:30:56,680 --> 00:30:57,640
You're Lu Zhuo's mother.

438
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,600
Everyone in this household
is watching you.

439
00:31:00,120 --> 00:31:01,080
You mustn't lose your composure.

440
00:31:02,080 --> 00:31:02,920
Physician Zhang,

441
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:07,520
you once served as a military physician
and have dealt with the Hutuo for decades.

442
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:09,480
I believe you're the only one
who can save Lu Zhuo.

443
00:31:09,560 --> 00:31:10,880
HE WANNIANG,
WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING'S ELDEST SON

444
00:31:10,960 --> 00:31:13,400
Tell me honestly. Can he still be saved?

445
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,800
Your Grace,

446
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:17,560
this is a poison
the Hutuo use for hunting.

447
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:19,720
Lord Lu has fought alongside you
since he was 12.

448
00:31:19,800 --> 00:31:21,680
He should have known how dangerous it was.

449
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:23,560
He should have returned
to the capital immediately

450
00:31:23,640 --> 00:31:25,840
to have the arrow removed,
the infected flesh cut away,

451
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:27,200
and the poisoned blood drained
with needles.

452
00:31:27,280 --> 00:31:28,600
Then he might have survived.

453
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,520
But he returned far too late.

454
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:35,920
I'm afraid
his chances of survival are slim.

455
00:31:52,600 --> 00:31:55,880
Zhuo can still be saved.

456
00:31:56,840 --> 00:31:58,280
I'll pray to the gods

457
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:02,720
and kneel at all 180 temples
in the capital.

458
00:32:03,800 --> 00:32:08,400
Even if I have to try
every remedy there is,

459
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:12,760
I'll find a way to save him!

460
00:32:19,120 --> 00:32:20,280
BEARING THE SUN'S RADIANCE

461
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:23,160
Mother was just instructing
the servants to prepare gifts

462
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:26,160
so she could visit you at your residence.

463
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:29,120
But unexpectedly,
you've come to see us first.

464
00:32:29,200 --> 00:32:30,800
You didn't even send word ahead,

465
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:34,040
or we would have arranged
a proper welcome.

466
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:38,480
Our families have been close
for generations.

467
00:32:39,080 --> 00:32:41,440
Once our two children are married,

468
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:43,880
we'll practically be one family.

469
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:46,280
Why bother with such formalities?

470
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:54,000
My dear, I've taken the liberty
of coming here today for one reason alone.

471
00:32:54,080 --> 00:32:56,880
It's about their marriage.

472
00:33:13,920 --> 00:33:16,320
Our families had an understanding

473
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:19,480
that once Lu Zhuo returned victorious,
we would hold the wedding.

474
00:33:19,560 --> 00:33:21,360
I've already chosen an auspicious date.

475
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:24,240
The 12th day of the fifth month.

476
00:33:25,040 --> 00:33:27,160
That's only five days away.

477
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:31,680
Your Grace, isn't that rather rushed?

478
00:33:31,760 --> 00:33:32,880
Indeed.

479
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:34,200
For families of our standing,

480
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:40,600
preparing a girl for marriage
can take three to five years.

481
00:33:41,120 --> 00:33:46,920
My dear, there's no need to pretend
you don't understand.

482
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:50,520
Wei Rao can afford to wait,

483
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:53,200
but my grandson cannot.

484
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:56,920
Lu Zhuo was wounded in battle
and is now bedridden.

485
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:00,240
The priest from Zhaotai Shrine
told me himself

486
00:34:00,320 --> 00:34:02,760
that Wei Rao has an auspicious destiny

487
00:34:02,840 --> 00:34:04,000
and is blessed
with both fortune and wisdom.

488
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:06,880
If she marries him to bring him
good fortune,

489
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:09,159
Lu Zhuo will surely pull through.

490
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:13,199
The wedding date
was also chosen by the priest himself.

491
00:34:13,800 --> 00:34:16,719
Let me make you a promise today.

492
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,679
As long as Wei Rao agrees to marry him,

493
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,280
whether Lu Zhuo wakes up or not,

494
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:23,320
our family will forever
be indebted to her.

495
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:27,080
If my grandson isn't fortunate enough
to have such a blessed wife,

496
00:34:27,159 --> 00:34:30,280
she may choose
any other young man in the Lu family

497
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:31,719
and marry whichever one she wishes.

498
00:34:32,760 --> 00:34:34,679
If she insists on leaving the Lu family,

499
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:38,719
I'll give her an additional 10,000 liang
for her dowry so she can remarry.

500
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:43,480
I understand now.

501
00:34:44,639 --> 00:34:49,280
The Duke of Ying's family
has loyally served our nation.

502
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:53,040
Lu Zhuo is a hero wounded in battle.

503
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:57,880
What I'm about to say may offend you,

504
00:34:58,600 --> 00:35:00,440
but I have to say it.

505
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:05,960
Lu Zhuo is gravely ill,
and no treatment has worked.

506
00:35:06,040 --> 00:35:08,960
Everyone in the capital knows it.

507
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:13,800
This granddaughter of mine
lost her father as a child.

508
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:20,720
And now you're forcing her
to bear the stigma of widowhood so young.

509
00:35:20,800 --> 00:35:23,960
You're practically sending her
to her death!

510
00:35:24,040 --> 00:35:25,600
Mother, please calm down.

511
00:35:25,680 --> 00:35:29,240
There are ways to put this more tactfully.

512
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:32,760
We shouldn't
damage the bond between our families.

513
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:35,480
I don't care about that now.

514
00:35:36,560 --> 00:35:39,080
Your eldest grandson may be precious,

515
00:35:39,600 --> 00:35:43,560
but that doesn't make
my granddaughter expendable.

516
00:35:44,320 --> 00:35:49,040
Back then, I had to bury my own son.

517
00:35:49,600 --> 00:35:54,080
And now, you expect my granddaughter
to marry Lu Zhuo

518
00:35:54,160 --> 00:35:55,680
in hopes of curing him?

519
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,760
LOTUS ROOM

520
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:01,640
I simply cannot agree.

521
00:36:02,240 --> 00:36:08,280
You lost your son,
and that was a terrible tragedy.

522
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:12,600
But three of my four sons died,
and the remaining one was left disabled.

523
00:36:12,680 --> 00:36:14,320
Who can I turn to with my grief?

524
00:36:15,520 --> 00:36:17,880
I blame neither Heaven nor anyone else.

525
00:36:17,960 --> 00:36:20,360
Such is the fate of the men in my family.

526
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:25,000
But Lu Zhuo
fought for our country and its people.

527
00:36:25,080 --> 00:36:27,400
Without his courage on the front lines,

528
00:36:27,480 --> 00:36:30,000
would your family enjoy peace
and prosperity today?

529
00:36:32,120 --> 00:36:34,120
To save my grandson's life,

530
00:36:34,640 --> 00:36:36,400
even if I have to use
my family's influence,

531
00:36:36,480 --> 00:36:39,280
I'll make sure your granddaughter's
bridal carriage enters our gates!

532
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:41,600
If there's any retribution,

533
00:36:41,680 --> 00:36:43,360
even if I must endure thousands of cuts,

534
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:45,400
I'll bear it alone.

535
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:51,560
As for this marriage,

536
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:58,000
Old Madam Wei,
you have no choice but to agree to it.

537
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,280
Reporting!

538
00:37:03,160 --> 00:37:04,320
An attendant from Changle Palace

539
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:05,360
has arrived with an edict
from the Empress Dowager.

540
00:37:24,720 --> 00:37:26,280
Open the main gates.

541
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,320
Set up the incense table.

542
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:33,960
Follow me
to receive the Empress Dowager's edict.

543
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:45,360
Well.

544
00:37:45,440 --> 00:37:47,240
Rao, checking out your dowry?

545
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:50,640
Lady Chan, you can't just barge in.

546
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:54,520
- Lady Chan…
- Can't I have a word with my cousin?

547
00:37:59,920 --> 00:38:01,800
All these jade ornaments
and gold bracelets,

548
00:38:02,520 --> 00:38:04,160
yet you may never get to wear any of them.

549
00:38:05,040 --> 00:38:08,440
Traditionally,
a widow mourning her husband

550
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:11,920
must wear the coarsest hemp clothing

551
00:38:12,520 --> 00:38:13,600
for three years.

552
00:38:14,640 --> 00:38:16,040
Take my advice.

553
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:18,720
Pack plenty of coarse hemp
for your wedding,

554
00:38:18,800 --> 00:38:21,520
so you won't be caught unprepared.

555
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:22,440
What did you say?

556
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:27,680
Don't tell me
you still haven't heard, Rao.

557
00:38:28,800 --> 00:38:30,600
Lu Zhuo's injuries are beyond treatment.

558
00:38:30,680 --> 00:38:32,000
He's at death's door.

559
00:38:32,520 --> 00:38:36,400
Your bridal carriage may have barely
entered his residence

560
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:39,400
before you find yourself a widow.

561
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:43,320
You pretend to be so dutiful and proper,

562
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:46,040
but you abuse your maids and commit
all sorts of vile acts.

563
00:38:46,680 --> 00:38:48,440
Only Grandmother falls for your act.

564
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:52,200
Like mother, like daughter.

565
00:38:52,280 --> 00:38:53,280
Just look at you.

566
00:38:53,360 --> 00:38:55,480
You were born to bring misfortune
to your husband,

567
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:56,560
just like your birth mother.

568
00:38:57,240 --> 00:38:59,240
As if brought death upon Second Uncle
weren't enough,

569
00:39:00,120 --> 00:39:02,640
she shamelessly chased wealth and status.

570
00:39:03,160 --> 00:39:05,600
A vulgar woman through and through.

571
00:39:10,640 --> 00:39:12,280
I never turned on you before

572
00:39:13,680 --> 00:39:15,520
because you were still useful to me.

573
00:39:17,040 --> 00:39:19,400
But you crossed me first this time.

574
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,560
What are you going to do?

575
00:39:30,040 --> 00:39:31,480
Go get Grandmother and Mother!

576
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:33,440
- Show them her true colors!
- Yes.

577
00:39:40,160 --> 00:39:43,880
She's trying to kill me! Murderer!

578
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:45,200
BEGONIA COURT

579
00:39:45,280 --> 00:39:46,480
Mother, don't worry.

580
00:39:46,560 --> 00:39:48,360
- Sisters bicker all the time.
- Hurry!

581
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:50,320
- Let's hurry.
- It's nothing serious.

582
00:39:57,240 --> 00:39:58,520
Grandmother!

583
00:39:58,600 --> 00:39:59,800
What happened?

584
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:02,120
Grandmother!

585
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:03,840
Wei Rao's gone mad!

586
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:06,800
She's trying to kill your granddaughter!

587
00:40:06,880 --> 00:40:08,440
What's gotten into you two?

588
00:40:10,560 --> 00:40:12,000
Someone help!

589
00:40:12,080 --> 00:40:13,880
- Help!
- Help!

590
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:16,040
My Lady…

591
00:40:17,200 --> 00:40:19,160
- Someone, please!
- Get in here and save her!

592
00:40:19,240 --> 00:40:20,640
Get her down!

593
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:24,040
What are you doing?

594
00:40:24,120 --> 00:40:26,080
Get her down! Hurry!

595
00:40:26,160 --> 00:40:27,480
Lower her! This is terrible!

596
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:29,520
Quick! Get her down!

597
00:40:29,600 --> 00:40:30,640
Are you all right?

598
00:40:32,560 --> 00:40:35,000
Rao, what were you thinking?

599
00:40:35,080 --> 00:40:35,920
You foolish child.

600
00:40:37,160 --> 00:40:38,040
What are you waiting for?

601
00:40:38,120 --> 00:40:40,560
- Go get some water! Hurry!
- Yes.

602
00:40:40,640 --> 00:40:41,760
Here, drink slowly.

603
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,320
Have some water first.

604
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:47,240
You foolish girl.

605
00:40:47,320 --> 00:40:49,320
What on earth has happened to you?

606
00:40:49,400 --> 00:40:51,160
You could have told me.

607
00:40:51,680 --> 00:40:53,160
I could have sought justice for you,

608
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:56,880
and your grandmother
could have helped you!

609
00:40:56,960 --> 00:41:00,800
Why would you resort
to taking your own life?

610
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:05,720
Ma,

611
00:41:06,600 --> 00:41:08,680
I only came to comfort her.

612
00:41:08,760 --> 00:41:10,680
But when she heard she had to marry
into the Lu family,

613
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:11,800
she suddenly turned on me

614
00:41:11,880 --> 00:41:13,360
and started hitting and cursing me
like a madwoman.

615
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:14,960
I'm her older cousin!

616
00:41:16,160 --> 00:41:17,160
Grandmother!

617
00:41:21,480 --> 00:41:22,600
Kneel.

618
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:24,560
Get on your knees!

619
00:41:25,080 --> 00:41:26,520
You thoughtless girl.

620
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:29,360
Your grandmother kept it from her
to protect the family.

621
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:31,360
How dare you blurt it out and upset her?

622
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:36,080
How utterly reckless and foolish!

623
00:41:36,800 --> 00:41:38,720
You've caused so much trouble.

624
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:40,040
Hurry up and apologize.

625
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:43,160
Look what she did to me!

626
00:41:44,160 --> 00:41:46,000
She's always putting on an act,
pretending to be innocent,

627
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:47,800
and you all fall for it!

628
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:50,680
- Every single time, you take her side!
- Enough!

629
00:41:52,240 --> 00:41:55,080
Go and kneel in the ancestral hall
for three days and nights.

630
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:57,680
No one is to bring her food!

631
00:41:57,760 --> 00:41:58,760
Yes.

632
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:05,720
Everyone, leave us!

633
00:42:15,800 --> 00:42:18,360
Rao… Rao…

634
00:42:20,160 --> 00:42:21,560
Grandmother,

635
00:42:22,120 --> 00:42:24,920
I've been ill-fated since childhood,

636
00:42:26,560 --> 00:42:29,880
with no parents to love me
and no brothers to rely on.

637
00:42:29,960 --> 00:42:32,960
I've survived this long
only because of you.

638
00:42:33,040 --> 00:42:37,160
But Lu Zhuo is already at death's door.

639
00:42:37,240 --> 00:42:39,040
If I marry him, I'll end up a widow.

640
00:42:40,120 --> 00:42:41,560
People may start saying that
the women of the Wei family

641
00:42:41,640 --> 00:42:43,040
bring death to their husbands,

642
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:46,360
which will tarnish our family's name
and my cousins' reputations.

643
00:42:47,160 --> 00:42:50,120
I… I'd be better off dead!

644
00:42:50,200 --> 00:42:52,600
Rao! Rao…

645
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:54,840
Rao…

646
00:42:58,440 --> 00:42:59,280
Ma,

647
00:42:59,360 --> 00:43:03,240
my second brother loved Rao more than
anyone when he was alive.

648
00:43:03,320 --> 00:43:05,160
She's his only child.

649
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:09,080
What does it matter
how noble the Lu family is?

650
00:43:09,960 --> 00:43:10,960
If they want to be heroes,

651
00:43:11,040 --> 00:43:12,680
let them do it themselves!

652
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:15,120
Why drag innocent Rao into this?

653
00:43:16,200 --> 00:43:17,720
Besides,

654
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:21,160
Rao's birth mother
already has such a reputation…

655
00:43:21,240 --> 00:43:22,840
You be quiet too!

656
00:43:24,080 --> 00:43:25,480
Never mention that woman to me again!

657
00:43:31,040 --> 00:43:33,400
If I had any other choice,

658
00:43:35,160 --> 00:43:39,320
do you think I'd sacrifice Rao?

659
00:43:41,000 --> 00:43:44,800
But the Duke's family
has outmaneuvered us.

660
00:43:45,720 --> 00:43:48,360
They've secured an edict
from the Empress Dowager.

661
00:43:50,120 --> 00:43:52,600
Do you expect me to openly defy it

662
00:43:52,680 --> 00:43:55,920
and send our entire family
to the scaffold?

663
00:43:59,680 --> 00:44:01,520
An edict from the Empress Dowager?

664
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:09,600
Rao, for the sake of our household

665
00:44:10,320 --> 00:44:12,840
and the safety of the entire Wei family,

666
00:44:14,960 --> 00:44:20,480
you should forget you ever had me
as your grandmother!

667
00:44:24,200 --> 00:44:25,040
Ma…

668
00:44:29,000 --> 00:44:30,160
Grandmother…

669
00:44:30,240 --> 00:44:32,400
Ma, please save Rao!

670
00:44:33,040 --> 00:44:35,160
Grandmother!

671
00:44:35,240 --> 00:44:36,880
Ma!

672
00:44:43,200 --> 00:44:44,520
I can't count on Grandmother anymore.

673
00:44:46,560 --> 00:44:50,040
Aunt Heng'e,
you've always cared for me the most.

674
00:44:51,200 --> 00:44:52,400
Will you help me?

675
00:44:53,560 --> 00:44:54,720
How?

676
00:45:06,600 --> 00:45:09,520
Aunt Heng'e, I don't want to be a widow.

677
00:45:19,800 --> 00:45:20,640
Rao,

678
00:45:23,880 --> 00:45:24,760
don't worry.

679
00:45:24,840 --> 00:45:27,080
Even if I have to search
the entire capital,

680
00:45:28,280 --> 00:45:32,680
I'll find someone to marry in your place.

681
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:51,960
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
